//
// STATUS RULES (enforced by tests/seo/business-verification.test.mjs)
//   VERIFIED        independent evidence is on file (the `onFile` field names it). Nothing in the website configuration, the
//                   claims registry or a legacy document counts as independent evidence. No item is VERIFIED today.
//   PROVISIONAL     approved public copy or a single source exists; it is not independently verified.
//   CONFLICTED      two or more sources disagree (the `conflict` field is non-empty if and only if the status is CONFLICTED).
//   MISSING         nothing usable exists.
//   NOT APPLICABLE  no page needs the item.
